%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': { 'fontSize':'22px'}}}%%
flowchart TB
    Ideas[💡 Ideas]
    Build[("BUILD<br/>👥 CPO + ⚙️ CTO")]
    Product[📦 Product]
    Measure[("MEASURE<br/>⚙️ CTO + 👥 CPO")]
    Data[📊 Data]
    Learn[("LEARN<br/>📊 CEO + Team")]

    Ideas -.->|Strategic<br/>Decision| Build
    Build ==>|Execute &<br/>Create| Product
    Product -.-> Measure
    Measure ==>|Auto<br/>Collect| Data
    Data -.-> Learn
    Learn ==>|Analyze &<br/>Synthesize| Ideas

    style Build fill:#3498DB,stroke:#2C3E50,stroke-width:4px,color:#fff,font-weight:bold
    style Measure fill:#F1C40F,stroke:#2C3E50,stroke-width:4px,color:#2C3E50,font-weight:bold
    style Learn fill:#2ECC71,stroke:#2C3E50,stroke-width:4px,color:#fff,font-weight:bold
    style Ideas fill:#fff,stroke:#2C3E50,stroke-width:2px,color:#2C3E50,font-style:italic
    style Product fill:#fff,stroke:#2C3E50,stroke-width:2px,color:#2C3E50,font-style:italic
    style Data fill:#fff,stroke:#2C3E50,stroke-width:2px,color:#2C3E50,font-style:italic

    classDef phaseClass font-size:20px
    class Build,Measure,Learn phaseClass
